codex
Fixed disconnect cleanup by tying the backend connection task to the response body. Added a regression test verifying that disconnect releases backend resources. SSE format is unchanged.

Both acceptance commands passed. The existing live-daemon test skipped because no daemon was running; the new regression ran and passed.

Only this checkout was changed. No commit created.
